  "description": "Ready for adrenaline. Ready for action. Our NDURO 7 is at home on the most demanding trails – and the perfect toy for freeriders and bike park fans. The compact and powerful Yamaha PW-X3 motor gets you to the start of your favourite trail at any time. The 180mm travel at the front and rear, mullet setup with 29″ front wheel and 27.5″ rear, plus the Magura MT5 disc brakes, offer you everything you need to shred. Strong: thanks to the geometry, you don’t have to sacrifice performance on technical uphills or demanding downhills. The progressive rear triangle with anti-squat properties offers you even more efficiency on the mountain. In short: an Enduro eMTB for lots of action and even more adrenaline.",
